Fighter - Dps/Combat/Weps
    {"name":"twin strikes","req":"fighter 1","tags":"","effect":"Once per turn, when you do an Attack you may spend 2 Strain or Empowered to do another Attack with the same Attack Sum.","extra":""},
    {"name":"defender","req":"fighter 1","tags":"","effect":"When you hit a target with Melee Attack you may spend 1 Strain or Empowered to have them be Rooted until the start of your next turn.\nAdditionally, once per Break or Rest, refund 3 Strain when you lose all of your SHIELDING.","extra":""},
    Missing - OOC?
    {"name":"battle ready","req":"fighter 1","tags":"","effect":"At the end of a Break or Rest you may perform a ritual. Then, choose one of the following benefits to gain at the beginning of your next combat:\n- You have +2 on Initiative.\n- Lock a 6.\n- You are Empowered for BODY turns.","extra":""},
    
    {"name":"whirlwind","req":"fighter 2","tags":"","effect":"You can move through dense crowds, or tiles that are occupied by creatures as if it was Rough Terrain.\nAdditionally, once per turn, refund 3 Strain when you do a Melee Attack against 2 or more creatures in a turn.","extra":""},
    {"name":"braced for impact","req":"fighter 2","tags":"","effect":"When you Hunker Down you take 1 less damage from Attacks (to a minimum of 1).\nAt the start of your turn, if you took damage since your last turn, refund 2 Strain.","extra":""},

    {"name":"melee weapon master","req":"fighter 3","tags":"","effect":"When you wield a Melee Weapon you get a bonus based on its type:\n- **One Handed**: +1 to the Bonus threshold (from 7 to 8).\n- **Two Handed**: Attacks gain 2 Reaching (or +1 Reaching if it has Reaching\n- **Side**: You may give a 6 instead of ## for an Attack. This Attack gains +2 to its sum.\n- **Hammer**: You may have the target go Prone instead of applying Knockback.","extra":""},
    {"name":"guarding presence","req":"body 3","tags":"","effect":"While you are Hunkered Down your non-area Arts have +3 range.","extra":""},
    
    {"name":"true strikes","req":"fighter 4","tags":"","effect":"When you give a 12 on a Melee Attack you do not gain the Weapon Downside.\nWhen you give a 8 or less on a Melee Attack you are unaffected by Blind","extra":""},
    {"name":"total defence","req":"fighter 4","tags":"","effect":"You gain Resistance to Physical damage, and may spend Strain instead of loosing health or shielding.","extra":""},
    
    
    
Survivor - Healing/Buffs/Movement
    {"name":"trained medic","req":"survivor 1","tags":"","effect":"When you use a Bandage you may spend ## and the Bandage to heal 2d4+[BODY or MIND] (Instead of 1+1d4).","extra":""},
    {"name":"escapist","req":"survivor 1","tags":"","effect":"When you roll a 3 or less on a Check, Contest, or Dodge roll (before bonuses) gain +1 on your next Check, Contest, or Dodge roll.","extra":""},
    {"name":"athlete","req":"survivor 1","tags":"","effect":"You are not Slowed when climbing or swimming and if you willingly move 2 times in a turn gain Warded until the end of your next Turn.","extra":""},
    {"name":"momentum","req":"survivor 1","tags":"","effect":"After you willingly move you gain +1 Speed, to a maximum of your BODY, until the end of your turn.","extra":""},

    {"name":"last wind","req":"survivor 2","tags":"","effect":"Once per Break or Rest you may choose to gain +1d4 on a Check, heal 2+BODY, or refund 2+BODY Strain.","extra":""},
    {"name":"field tending","req":"survivor 2","tags":"","effect":"At the end of a Break you may roll a number of d4 equal to your [BODY or MIND]. You pick any number of Creatures you can see. Heal a total amount of health equal to the dice rolled. The healing may be given to one creature or divided as among several. You cannot target Undead or Constructs.","extra":""},

    {"name":"???","req":"survivor 3","tags":"","effect":"When you would lose Focus (such as going unconscious or gaining a stack of Death's Door) you may spend 2 Strain to not lose Focus.","extra":""},
    {"name":"medical professional","req":"survivor 3","tags":"","effect":"All of your healing effects heal for an additional +1. Additionally, once per Rest, when you heal a creature you may remove a stack of Death's Door from them. ","extra":""},

    {"name":"surgeon","req":"survivor 4","tags":"","effect":"When you heal a creature, activate a non-damaging Art, or give Empowered or Warded: you or the target may refund 1 Strain. Additionally, your healing may reattach limbs or permanently modify the appearance of the creature.","extra":""},
