    {"name":"patient","req":"mind 1","tags":"","effect":" At the end of your turn (10 seconds) increase your Locked Dice by 1, to a maximum of 6. If you do not have a Locked dice Lock a 1.","extra":""},
    {"name":"acute memory","tags":"","effect":"You can spend 1 minute to perfectly memorize something. You do not need to do a MIND roll when trying to recall this information. \nYou also always know the approximate time, what paths you took to get here, and have +1d4 against memory altering effects (such as from the Art 'Deja Vu').","req":"mind 1","extra":""},
