    {"name":"tag team","req":"mind 1","tags":"","effect":"At the end of your turn, Mark all targets you damaged this turn until the start of your next turn.\nOnce per round, if a Marked target dies or the Mark is spent you refund 2 Strain.\nYou may spend a Locked Dice to move Marked from one creature you can see to another you can see.","extra":""},
