Druidic - AOE/Arts/Healing/CC
    {"name":"nature preserve","req":"druidic 1","tags":"","effect":"At the start of your turn you may Focus on targeting a point within 9 tiles of you. Everything within 3 tiles of the point becomes your Territory. At the start of your turn or whenever a creature enters this Territory you may spend a Locked Dice to activate a single target Art against them. Use 3+# for any sums. (This Art still costs Strain.)","extra":""},
    {"name":"wildshape","req":"druidic 1","tags":"","effect":"Spend 1 Strain to change into a new animal form. This must be of an animal you know of (though you don't need to have encountered it) and cannot be much larger than yourself (though it may be smaller). This change lasts until you dismiss it, gain stacks of Death's Door, or your next Break or Rest. While in this form you must use a Bite ('Dagger'), Claws ('Mace'), or a Ram Attack ('Club'), cannot use Items or Arts that target anything other than yourself (Weapon Attack Arts still can be used), and gain abilities that would relate to that animal. For example, a spider can climb walls and spin webs, while a bird can fly.\n- Your Health, Shielding, Dodge, Strain, Stats, and other Traits remain unchanged.\nAdditionaly, when you transform you may spend 3 additional Strain to transform into a Large/Huge animal (2x2 or 3x3) gaining 2 Reaching, +2 damage on Attacks, and -1 Dodge.","extra":""},
    {"name":"local grove","req":"druidic 1","tags":"","effect":"While you take a Break or Rest you can turn everything within 9 tiles of you into a miniature Grove. In this Grove targets of your choice are Obscured from creatures outside the Grove, can't be detected by magic, and gain +1d4 for Sences rolls.","extra":""},
    {"name":"herbal medicine","req":"druidic 1","tags":"","effect":"When you heal a creature pick one additional benefit: +1d6 healing, give 1 Speed,  or give Warded until the end of the healed creatures next turn.","extra":""},

    {"name":"shifting winds","req":"druidic 2","tags":"","effect":"Once per turn, you may spend 1 Strain to move effects that target an area up to 3 tiles. This can move effects outside of their normal maximum range.","extra":""},
    {"name":"naturespeak","req":"druidic 2","tags":"","effect":"You are able to talk to plants and animals as though they were people. You may use Presence instead of Awareness when rolling Handling and can overhear conversations they may have. (This does NOT make them intelligent only lets you speak with them.)","extra":""},

    {"name":"floral","req":"druidic 3","tags":"","effect":"At the end of a Rest pick Grow, Wither, or Harvest.\n- **Grow:** Your Arts that affect an area have +1 to the radius. When you heal a creature with Wet, you heal an extra 1d4.\n- **Wither:** Creatures that are affected by Arts that have an area do -1 damage on Attacks, and you may spend 1 Strain to give them -1d4 on a check or contest.\n- **Harvest:** Once per turn, when you damage a creature with an Art, you may heal 2 health or gain Empowered until the end of your turn.","extra":""},
    {"name":"natural energies","req":"druidic 3","tags":"","effect":"Once per turn, when you or your Followers target a creature give them Empowered, NATURE Bonus Shielding, 2 Stun, Slowed, or apply NATURE Knockback. These effects last until the beginning of your next turn (except Knockback).","extra":""},
    
    {"name":"laeline traveler","req":"druidic 4","tags":"","effect":"When you activate a Trait or Art that effects an area, you may spend 2 Strain to teleport into an unoccupied space you can see inside of that area. If the Art is instantaneous you may choose to teleport before or after any effects take place.","extra":""},
    Missing
    
    
Ranger - Marked/Cloaked/Damage
    {"name":"hunter","req":"ranger 1","tags":"","effect":"At the start of your turn, designate a creature you can see as your Prey. You may only have 1 creature as your Prey at a time. You and your Followers have +1 on Attack Sums and Contests against your Prey.","extra":""},
    {"name":"bloodhound","req":"ranger 1","tags":"","effect":"You have Advantage when tracking a damaged creature and gain +1 Speed when moving towards a creature that is damaged or has a Debuff applied to them (such as Burn, Slow, Rooted, Stun, or Marked).","extra":""},
    {"name":"hidden paths","req":"ranger 1","tags":"","effect":"While traveling through terrain you are familiar with you and allies spend half the time to get from one location to another, and gain +1d4 on Checks and Contests for any stealth or foraging rolls.","extra":""},
    {"name":"beastbound","req":"ranger 1","tags":"","effect":"You have bonded with a Beast Follower. The Beast has 2xNATURE+LEVEL Max Health, LEVEL Strain, 0 Dodge, 6 Speed, 1 Body or Mind (Your choice), 2 Nature, and 0 for all other Stats. The Beast has the Art 'track creature' and two Tier 1 Arts of your choice (it needs the stat in order to take an Art). It has the type Animal, can be ridden as a Mount, and a Bite ('Dagger'), Claws ('Mace'), or a Ram Attack ('Club').\n- When you gain a stat increase the Beast gains +1 in a Sub-Stat of your choice. If the Beast was to go to 0 health they go unconscious instead of dying.\n\nThe Beast improves as you do gaining the following benefits when you hit certain Tiers.\n- *Tier 2* - The Beast gains +1 Dodge and either a Spit Attack ('Short Bow') or +1 Speed.\n- *Tier 3* - The Beast does +1 damage and learns an additional Tier 2 Art.\n- *Tier 4* - The Beast rolls 4 Combat Dice (instead of 3).","extra":""},
    
    {"name":"???","req":"ranger 2","tags":"","effect":"When you gain Cloaked your Followers may gain Cloaked as well.\nAdditionally, While in terrain you are familiar with you and your Followers may stop moving for a minute to become Invisible until you move.","extra":""},
    {"name":"??? (needs ooc)","req":"ranger 2","tags":"","effect":"When you or a Follower spend Marked or Cloaked on an Attack gain +Nature damage, remove 3 Shielding then do damage, or apply Slow until the end of the targets next turn.","extra":""},
    
