Urchin - Cloaked/Damage/Illusion
    {"name":"cat burglar","req":"thieving 1","tags":"","effect":"You do not need Thieves' Tools to lockpick, and may spend 10 minutes and 2 Strain to make a copy of any non-magical key you have seen or felt.\nAdditionally, you make no noise while climbing or falling up to half your Speed, and you can climb using THIEVING instead of BODY.","extra":""},
    {"name":"assassin","req":"urchin 1","tags":"","effect":"When you spend Cloaked on an Attack you may increase the Attack's damage by a number of d4 equal to your FINENESS instead of +1d6. This must be announced before the target does a Dodge roll.\nAdditionally, If you kill or incapacitate a creature while Hidden or Invisible you do not lose Hidden or Invisible.","extra":""},
    {"name":"spell thief","req":"thieving 1","tags":"","effect":"When you see a creature, other than yourself, activate an Art you may spend a Locked Dice to know it for 1 hour. You are able to know a number of Arts with this Trait up to SOUL+THIEVING+1 at a time.","extra":""},
    {"name":"illusionist","req":"thieving 1","tags":"","effect":"Your Arts that create illusions can be activated without gestures or sounds, can be activated with +3 range, and last for twice as long.","extra":""},
    
    {"name":"eyes of the night","req":"thieving 2","tags":"","effect":"You can see in poorly light areas as if they were illuminated up to 18 tiles away, and can see through Obscured or Darkened areas you created.","extra":""},
    {"name":"hidden power","req":"thieving 2","tags":"","effect":"While you are Hidden or Invisible you may conceal the fact that you are activating a Trait or Art. The Trait or Art makes no noise (unless the it is designed to) and activating a non-damaging Trait or Art does not break you out of Hidden or Invisibility.","extra":""},
    
    Missing
    {"name":"facade","req":"thieving 3","tags":"","effect":"When you get Hit, you may spend a Locked Dice and 4 Strain to leave an illusionary clone in your place. You then take half damage (minimum of 1) and may move up to 3 tiles in any direction. (This may still provoke Overwatch Attacks.)","extra":""},
    
    {"name":"shadow shapes","req":"thieving 4","tags":"","effect":"Your illusions are so real that they have physical form. These illusions only feel real and cannot interact with the world aside from touch (they cannot do damage, activate Arts, use Traits, etc). Physical illusions have 1 health.","extra":""},
    {"name":"master thief","req":"thieving 4","tags":"","effect":"When you gain Cloaked you may spend 1 Strain to become Hidden as well.","extra":""},
    
    
  




























    





