{"name":"artificer","tags":"","effect":"You may Bind to any number of magic items.\nArts you activate that target an item and have a duration have no maximum duration and do not require Focus. (You cannot apply the same Art on the same target multiple times.)\nArt created structures (such as Cube) you create have no duration.","req":"arcana 4, crafting 4","extra":""},
{"name":"invert anima","tags":"","effect":"When you spend Strain on a Damaging Attack or Art you may heal any target(s) rather than do damage for the amount of damage they would take. If you activate a Focus Art this effect lasts for the entire duration.","req":"arcana 4, medicine 4","extra":""},
{"name":"stolen knowledge","tags":"","effect":"After another creature activates an Art you may spend a Lock Slot (preventing you from Locking a dice) to steal the Art. The creature forgets the Art and you know the Art until your next Break or Rest. (Arts that last more than one turn do not end from this action, such as Focus or Summon Arts)","req":"arcana 4, thieving 4","extra":""},
{"name":"gang up","req":"crafting 4, thieving 4","tags":"","effect":"When you or a creature you have effected with an Art (such as a buff or Follower) damage a target, they deal +1 damage for every ally creature within 1 tile of the target.\nWhen you do a Check or Contest you gain +1 for every non-Follower ally creature within 3 tiles of you.","extra":""},
{"name":"flourishing","tags":"","effect":"Once per turn, after you apply Charmed to a creature you may activate an Art that doesn't cost Strain without spending dice. Use an 6 for any sums needed.\nOnce per turn, after you apply Rooted to a creature you may do a Charm contest against them. If you win they gain Charmed for as long as they are Rooted.","req":"charm 4, nature 4","extra":""},
{"name":"triage","tags":"","effect":"When you heal a creature, activate a non-damaging Art, or give Charmed, Empowered, or Rallied; you or the target may refund 1 Strain.","req":"charm 4, medicine 4","extra":""},
{"name":"charlatan","tags":"","effect":"You have +THIEVING on all checks or contests against creatures you have Charmed.\nWhen you would give Charmed to a creature you may instead give them Marked or Feared for the same duration.","req":"charm 4, thieving 4","extra":""},
{"name":"synthetic pollination","tags":"","effect":"Once per turn, when you or a Follower gain a positive effect from an Art or Item, you may spend 3 Strain to give that effect to up to 3 other creatures within 8 tiles of you.","req":"crafting 4, nature 4","extra":""},
{"name":"master of ephemera","tags":"","effect":"When you activate an Item, or when another creature consumes an Alchemical item you made, double the duration, gain +1 radius on area effects, do +2 damage, and/or give +LEVEL Bonus Shielding to any affected targets.","req":"crafting 4, medicine 4","extra":""},
{"name":"natural conduction","tags":"","effect":"When you deal damage to a creature you may instead make the creature spend half as much Strain (rounded up) and deal 2 damage.\nWhen you heal another creature you may instead make the creature refund half as much Strain (rounded up) and not heal.","req":"nature 4, medicine 4","extra":""},




{"name":"reflect projectile","req":"body 3","tags":"","effect":"While you are Hunkered Down if you Dodge a Ranged Physical Attack, you may spend 2 Strain to Throw it back with a 6 for the Attack Sum. The Attack keeps any Bonuses and/or Downsides and cant gain additional effects.","extra":""},
{"name":"parkourist","req":"body 1","tags":"","effect":"When you do an Attack after moving or falling you gain Empowered until the end of your turn.\nYou can run along walls as if it was normal terrain. You cannot stop while on a wall otherwise you will fall to the ground.\nAdditionally, when you Jump add 2 to the distance jumped.","extra":""},
    {"name":"tavern brawler","req":"body 2","tags":"","effect":"Your Fist and improvised Weapon Attacks have +1 to their Bonus threshold (from 7 to 8).\nAdditionally, while you have a target Grappled you can spend 2 Strain to Throw them 6 tiles. If they land on an object or creature both targets take any Knockback damage.\n","extra":""},
    
    
{"name":"frenzy","tags":"","effect":"When you take damage you may spend 1 Strain to become Empowered until the end of your next Turn.\nWhile you are Empowered after you do an Attack you may remove Empowered to do another Attack with the same sum.","req":"body 1","extra":""},
{"name":"bouncer","tags":"","effect":"When a target moves within 1 tile of you, you may do a Grapple Contest against them without spending Dice.\nOnce per Turn, refund 1 Strain when you grapple a creature.","req":"body 2","extra":""},
{"name":"smother","tags":"","effect":"When you first grapple a creature you may have them be Blinded or Silenced, while you have them Grappled.\nWhile you have a target Grappled, you may spend 1 Strain to do 1 damage to the target. You may do this any number of times in a turn.","req":"body 3","extra":""},
{"name":"armored resilience","req":"body 4","tags":"","effect":"Once per turn, when you take damage, if you were to lose all Shielding (including Bonus Shielding) any additional damage (to health) is reduced to 0 for that source of damage.","extra":""},

