{"name":"sniper","tags":"","effect":"Your Weapon Attacks do an additional +1 damage if the target is 12 or more tiles away.\nYou are able to see things up to 1 large tile (2,160x2,160 tiles) away as clear as if it was near you and you are able to read lips if you know the language.","req":"mind 3","extra":""},
{"name":"ranged weapon master","tags":"","effect":"Your Ranged Weapons have +2 Range.\nWhen using a Loading Weapon you may spend 2 ammo to gain the Weapon Bonus.\nWhen using a Bow, creatures you target do not gain +1 Dodge while Hunkered Down.","req":"mind 4","extra":""},

