{"name":"split art","req":"arcana 2","tags":"","effect":"Once per turn, when you activate an Art that has a single target you may spend 2 Strain to duplicate it and pick a different target.","extra":""},
{"name":"latent magics","req":"soul 1","tags":"","effect":"After you spend Strain to activate an Art, put a charge on this Trait. You may have up to 2+SOUL max charges. Later you may spend charges to do the below:\n- *Weapon* - Spend any number of Charges to gain bonus damage on a non-Art Attack equal to the charges spent.\n- *Discharge* - Spend charges instead of Strain for other Traits. (You cannot gain charges from Arts effected by this. Such as an Art effected by 'Art Manipulator')","extra":""},
{"name":"compressed arts","req":"arcana 3","tags":"","effect":"When you activate an Art that covers an area, you may spend 3 additional Strain to compress it to a singular target within the Art's range. Effects from the Art happen three times on the singular target. (Targets that do a Dodge, Contest, or similar roll must do it three times.)","extra":""},
{"name":"fine control","req":"arcana 2","tags":"","effect":"When you activate an Art that has an area effect, you may choose up to 2+ARCANA targets that are not affected by the Art.","extra":""},



