{"name":"intoxicating presence","tags":"","effect":"When a creature first sees you, you may do a Charm contest against them. If you win, the creature is Charmed for up to 1 hour.","req":"charm 1","extra":""},
{"name":"target audience","req":"charm 3","tags":"","effect":"When you activate an Art you may choose up to 2+CHARM creatures. Those creatures, and only those creatures, are effected and see, hear, or feel the Art.","extra":""},
{"name":"the show must go on","tags":"","effect":"When you activate a Focused Art on a creature that has been Charmed you may spend Charmed to double the duration of the Art.\nOnce per Rest, you may ignore the first time you would gain a stack of Death's Door.","req":"charm 4","extra":""},


