{"name":"duelist","req":"thieving 2","tags":"","effect":"While in a contest you initiated you may spend Empowered or 1 Strain to gain +1 to your roll.\nAdditionally, while you are wielding a Weapon in one hand and nothing in the other, that weapon does 1 extra damage. Fists do not count towards this trait, both for damage or offhanded.","extra":""},
{"name":"now you see me","req":"thieving 1","tags":"","effect":"When you Move while under the effects of a movement based Art or Trait you are Invisible. You are not Invisible during your turn, only when moving.\nAdditionally, while you are Hidden you may spend # (1 dice) and 1 Strain to turn Invisible until the end of your turn (10 seconds).","extra":""},
{"name":"trained","tags":"","effect":"When you attack a target that has Marked you may change the Attack Sum to 5. Additionally, you get +1 on contests, or Thieving checks you initiate against a Marked target.","req":"thieving 4","extra":""},




{"name":"elemental affinity","req":"nature 2","tags":"elemental","effect":"Whenever you activate an Art that applies Burn, Wet, Slow, or does Knockback, you may spend 1 Strain to do actions based on statuses given. Multiple actions may be activated per Art.\n- **Burn** - Move half of the Burn stacks from a target to a new target within 3 tiles of them.\n- **Wet** - Remove another status.\n- **Slow** - Give the target 2 Stun instead of Slow.\n- **Knockback** - Make the target go Prone instead of applying Knockback.","extra":""},
{"name":"elementalist","req":"nature 3","tags":"elemental","effect":"Whenever you activate an Art that applies Burn, Wet, Slow, or does Knockback, you may spend 1 Strain to do actions based on statuses given. Multiple actions may be activated per Art.\n- **Burn** - Remove all stacks of Burn from a target, refund Strain equal to half the stacks removed (rounded up).\n- **Wet** - Also give Rallied or do a Nature contest to make the target Prone.\n- **Slow** - Make all tiles within 1 tile of them into Rough Terrain until the beginning of your next turn.\n- **Knockback** - You may move the target in any direction, rather than just away, the same distance they would have been knocked back.","extra":""},



{"name":"build them break them","req":"crafting 1","tags":"","effect":"Followers or Art created structures (such as Cube) you create have an additional Shielding equal to your CRAFTING.\nYou do additional damage to objects and structures equal to your CRAFTING.","extra":""},
{"name":"field repair","req":"crafting 2","tags":"","effect":"When you give a target Bonus Shielding you may spend 1 extra Strain to repair that much Shielding (a creature cannot have more non-Bonus Shielding than what their normal armor would allow).\nAt the end of a Break or Rest give yourself and up to 8 targets Bonus Shielding equal to your CRAFTING or 1 Ward.","extra":""},
{"name":"master craftsman","req":"crafting 3","tags":"","effect":"When you give Shielding you give 2 additional Shielding.\nItems you make are worth twice their normal value.\nFollowers you create have an additional 1 Speed.","extra":""},



{"name":"empowering remedies","tags":"","effect":"When you heal a creature, or when they consume an Alchemical item you made, the creature becomes Empowered until the end of their next turn.\n\nMedicine 4 - When you heal a creature, or when they consume an alchemical item you made, the creature refunds 1 Strain.","req":"medicine 3","extra":""},
Alchemist - When you Tinker you may create an alchemical mixture as a new option. The mixture can be consumed or applied to a weapon without spending dice or strain, and becomes unusable after your next Rest. When made, pick one of the following: +1 Speed, Lock a 6, Resistance to Physical or Elemental damage, +1 damage, give Slow, give 2 Stun, Unconscious without doing damage, or fully heal, but gain a stack of Death's Door. These mixtures last for 1 minute (6 turns) once consumed.
{"name":"alchemical brewer","tags":"","effect":"At the end of a Rest you may create up to your MEDICINE non-Magical Alchemical items. You may only ever have up to your MEDICINE Alchemical items made this way at a time.","req":"medicine 1","extra":""},
{"name":"large doses","req":"medicine 4","tags":"","effect":"Alchemical items and Bandages you make may be used twice instead of once before they are spent.","extra":""},
Logical Mind - Strain Self to tiker better - When you Tinker you may Lock one of the dice rolled without effecting the result.
Medicine 3 - You may spend ### and 2 Strain or 1 hour, to combine 2 liquids together to make a Custom Brew. Custom Brews count as 1 Alchemical item and you cannot combine Custom Brews together.

{"name":"fast hands","tags":"","effect":"At the beginning of your turn, you may reload up to 2 ammo into your Loading weapons without spending dice.\nYou may spend 2 Strain instead of dice to activate any Item (use a 6 for any sum). You cannot do Attacks with this action.","req":"crafting 3","extra":""},
{"name":"creative innovations","req":"crafting 1","tags":"","effect":"At the end of a Rest you may make one of the following: Golem Clay, a Remote Control, or a Power Glove. You may only ever have one of these at a time and making a new one destroys the old one.\n- *Golem Clay* - A handful of clay that can be formed into the shape of an animal. When the Art 'Awaken Item' is activated on it, it behaves as that animal and gains abilities that would relate to that animal and can't be changed while awakened. For example, a spider can climb walls and spin webs, while a bird can fly. The clay also has Bite ('Dagger'), Claws ('Mace'), or a Ram Attack ('Club') which best fits the animal that is made.\n- *Remote Control* - A handheld device that lets you activate or deactivate items or Arts you have activated, touched, or made. (There is no maximum distance for this.)\n- *Power Glove* - A 1 handed glove which does 1+CRAFTING damage On Hit. You may use this glove to lift targets using Crafting instead of Body.\n\nCrafting 3 - Golem Clay's awakened item can be reformed while the Art is active. Remote Control can control items or Arts as if you had full control of them (instead of activate or deactivate). Power Glove lets you move Art created structures (such as Cube) without doing any rolls.\n","extra":""},



